  "description": "How far would you go to take down the person you hate most? With no house, no job, and nothing left to lose, Geun-Yeong Lee is willing to risk it all to bring down the country’s national treasure, Korean superstar Who-Joon. But once the two really get to know each other, bringing him down suddenly becomes a lot harder. Will she be able to ruin him once and for all after she learns the truth about the man behind the popstar?\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS) \n\n*Note: Includes prologue and special epilogue chapters.*",
